# No comments

- Never add comments in code (`//`, `/* */`, `/** */`, `///`, JSX `{/* */}`).
- Never create or update `README.txt` / `readme.txt`.
- Do not leave explanatory comments when editing existing files; delete leftover comments you touch.
- Keep required compiler directives only when unavoidable (e.g. `/// <reference types="vite/client" />`, `// @ts-expect-error` with a real need).
